  "body": "Title and CCC issued - ready to move in now!\r\nPerfectly positioned in the heart of the Macleans College zone, this brand-new 144sqm residence offers a level of versatility seldom found in new builds. While legally consented as a three-bedroom home, the layout includes a generous upstairs sitting room-complete with its own built-in wardrobe-offering an ideal \"flexi-space\" for a home office, a second lounge, or a tailored retreat to suit your lifestyle. This home is zoned for the area's most elite schools: Macleans College, Bucklands Beach Primary, and Bucklands Beach Intermediate.\r\n\r\nStep inside 145A  Bucklands Beach Road to discover a light-filled sanctuary designed for modern living. The ground floor features a spacious, open-plan lounge and dining area that flows effortlessly, complemented by a designer kitchen equipped with high-quality wall oven, cooktop, and dishwasher. With 2.5 bathrooms (including a master ensuite) and a total of three toilets, the home is perfectly equipped to handle the morning rush.\r\n\r\nThe upstairs \"flexi-room\" is the real surprise here; because it features a built-in wardrobe, it provides that much-needed extra space that many 3-bedroom homes lack. Whether you need a nursery, a quiet library, or a media room, this space adapts as your family grows.\r\n\r\nThe exterior is finished in classic weatherboard and includes a fully fenced backyard for peace of mind with pets and children. Enjoy your morning coffee on the deck while taking in local views and glimpses of the sea. Complete with a heat pump, full insulation, and a single internal-access garage, every detail has been considered for comfort.\r\n\r\nSecure your spot in the Macleans zone today-contact us for a private viewing.",
